Internal build artifact placeholder.

`make agent-binaries` fills this directory with the cross-compiled
agent binaries (pulsix-agent-linux-{amd64,arm64} plus their .sha256
checksums), which the manager then serves at
GET /agents/bin/linux/{arch}. This placeholder keeps `go:embed all:dist`
compilable without them — the binary routes answer 503 with
"run make agent-binaries" until they exist.
